THE OLD LOOP
have an idea
    → write the spec
        → design it
            → build it
                → ship
                    → learn
                        ↺


THE LOOP INVERTS
have an idea
    → build it
        → play with it
            → design it
                → ship
                    → learn
                        ↺


INSIGHT
Prototypes are now cheap.
Great products still require taste, judgment,
and a clear understanding of what users actually need.
